 that fail contrast."},"logoPath":{"description":"The logo's path from the project root (PNG, SVG, JPEG or WebP, ≤ 2 MB; the plain mark, not an app icon on a background). The file is not embedded: the import command sends it beside this file as `-F logo=@<logoPath>`. Leave out when the repository has no logo.","type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":300},"experience":{"type":"object","properties":{"assistantName":{"description":"One name, used for the persona and the thread header.","type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":40},"tone":{"type":"string","maxLength":4000},"instructions":{"type":"string","maxLength":4000},"guardrails":{"description":"One rule per line in the app's default language, each starting with its \"Always\" or \"Never\": \"Never promise a price.\", \"Asla fiyat sözü verme.\"","type":"string","maxLength":4000},"topics":{"description":"Topics it won't discuss, one per item, e.g. \"competitors' prices\".","maxItems":20,"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":120}},"languages":{"description":"Language subtags in order; the first is the fallback.","maxItems":12,"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[a-zA-Z]{2,3}(-[a-zA-Z0-9]{2,8})?$"}},"welcomeTitle":{"description":"The empty thread's headline.","type":"string","maxLength":80},"welcomeBody":{"description":"The line under it.","type":"string","maxLength":160},"suggestions":{"maxItems":4,"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":60}},"reason":{"description":"Why, in a sentence. Shown to the person reviewing a sync.","type":"string","maxLength":1000}},"additionalProperties":false,"description":"Who the assistant is, from the app's own copy and translations. `assistantName`: the name the app already uses for a helper, otherwise \"Rendel\". `tone`: how the app's text sounds, in a sentence or two. `instructions`: what it helps with. `guardrails`: one rule per line in the default language, each starting with that language's \"Always\" or \"Never\" (Turkish \"Her zaman …\", \"Asla …\"), including one against promising prices, refunds or dates the app's data does not show. `topics`: subjects it declines. `languages`: the app's locales, the default first. `welcomeTitle`, `welcomeBody` and up to 4 `suggestions`, in the default language, each one something a knowledge source or an action will answer."},"knowledge":{"description":"What the assistant knows. URLs: the app's public pages (help, pricing, FAQ, terms, privacy) as `\"kind\": \"url\"`; Rendel fetches them, you do not. Texts (`\"kind\": \"text\"`): what the code and in-app copy say, one source per topic (what each main screen is for and how to do its main tasks, FAQ, plans and prices as the app shows them, refund and cancellation rules, how to reach support), in the default language; facts only, no code, internal URLs, secrets or user data. A stable `external_key` each: `screen:<route>`, `faq:<topic>`, `plans`, `policy:refunds`, `url:<host/path>`. `{\"op\": \"archive\", \"external_key\": …}` removes one that is gone.","minItems":1,"maxItems":500,"type":"array","items":{"anyOf":[{"type":"object","properties":{"external_key":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":200,"description":"Your stable name for this item, e.g. `screen:settings/subscription` or `GET /v1/orders`. Sending the same key again updates it."},"kind":{"type":"string","const":"text"},"title":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":160},"content":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":200000},"reason":{"description":"Why, in a sentence. Shown to the person reviewing a sync.","type":"string","maxLength":1000}},"required":["external_key","kind","title","content"],"additionalProperties":false},{"type":"object","properties":{"external_key":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":200,"description":"Your stable name for this item, e.g. `screen:settings/subscription` or `GET /v1/orders`. Sending the same key again updates it."},"kind":{"type":"string","const":"url"},"title":{"type":